msgstr "快，走吧！"

#: slot/0x00a57090/0x12908e/0x0001aa
msgid "You can't beat the best!"
msgstr "你打不过最强！"

#: slot/0x00a57090/0x12908e/0x0001ab
msgid "That's gotta hurt!"
