#: slot/0x00a57090/0x12908e/0x0001b2
msgid "These guys are for real..."
msgstr "这些家伙是来真的……"

#: slot/0x00a57090/0x12908e/0x0001b3
msgid "That all you got?"
msgstr "你就这点本事？"

#: slot/0x00a57090/0x12908e/0x0001b4
